OL,3,GNEWSAHalloween costume swap launched by
OL,4,Acouncil
OL,5,
OL,6,FParents are being encouraged to
OL,7,Fexchange unwanted children's Halloween
OL,8,Fcostumes in a swap shop rather than
OL,9,Fthrow them away.
OL,11,FKnowsley Council has launched a costume
OL,12,Fswap during half-term in a bid to cut
OL,13,Fdown on waste.
OL,15,FIt said of the millions of people that
OL,16,Fdress up for Halloween across the
OL,17,Fcountry, about 90% of families buy new
OL,18,Fcostumes. Around 40% of Halloween
OL,19,Fcostumes are worn just once.
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
